{"ticker":"HAL","updated":"2026-10-23T23:03:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Halliburton Company","shortName":"Halliburton Company","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Equipment & Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.halliburton.com","fullTimeEmployees":46000,"marketCap":29092911104,"trailingPE":26.255636,"forwardPE":11.848051,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.294399,"pegRatio":0.69,"targetMeanPrice":43.68,"targetHighPrice":51.0,"targetLowPrice":29.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.018,"earningsGrowth":24.0,"grossMargins":0.14856,"operatingMargins":0.12432,"profitMargins":0.08903,"totalRevenue":22475999232,"beta":0.839,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":43.59,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":24.92,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.05},"summary":"Halliburton Company provides products and services to the energy industry worldwide. It operates in two segments, Completion and Production, and Drilling and Evaluation. The Completion and Production segment offers production enhancement services that include stimulation and sand control services; cementing services, such as well bonding and casing, and casing equipment; and completion tools that offer downhole solutions and services, including well completion products and services, intelligent well completions, liner hanger systems, sand control systems, multilateral systems, and service tools. This segment also provides electrical submersible pumps, as well as artificial lift services; production solutions comprising coiled tubing, hydraulic workover units, downhole tools, and pumping and nitrogen services; pipeline and process services, such as pre-commissioning, commissioning, maintenance, and decommissioning; and specialty chemicals and services. The Drilling and Evaluation segment offers drilling fluid systems, performance additives, completion fluids, solids control, specialized testing equipment, and waste management services; drilling systems and services; wireline and perforating services consisting of open-hole logging, and cased-hole and slickline; and drill bits and services comprising roller cone bits, fixed cutter bits, hole enlargement, and related downhole tool","summary_zh":"哈里伯頓公司為全球能源產業提供產品和服務。它分為兩個部門：完井和生產部門以及鑽井和評估部門。完井和生產部門提供增產服務，包括增產和防砂服務；固井服務，例如固井和套管以及套管設備；完井工具，提供井下解決方案和服務，包括完井產品和服務、智慧完井、尾管懸掛系統、防砂系統、多邊系統和服務工具。該部門還提供電動潛水泵以及人工舉升服務；生產解決方案包括連續油管、液壓修井機、井下工具以及泵送和氮氣服務；管道和工藝服務，例如預調試、調試、維護和退役；以及特種化學品和服務。鑽井和評估部門提供鑽井系統、高性能添加劑、完井液、固相控制、專業測試設備和廢棄物管理服務；鑽井系統和服務；電纜和射孔服務，包括裸眼測井、套管井和鋼絲；鑽頭和服務，包括牙輪鑽頭、固定刀頭、擴孔和相關井下工具","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣設備與服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":22.19,"h":22.49,"l":22.01,"c":22.34,"v":8647000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":22.01,"h":22.29,"l":21.76,"c":21.88,"v":15318300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":21.84,"h":22.48,"l":21.79,"c":22.3,"v":8433700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":22.37,"h":22.7,"l":22.07,"c":22.63,"v":11982400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":22.62,"h":22.86,"l":22.52,"c":22.73,"v":8064700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":22.67,"h":22.78,"l":22.26,"c":22.69,"v":11560000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":22.3,"h":22.53,"l":21.57,"c":21.59,"v":12590100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":21.65,"h":22.48,"l":21.4,"c":22.47,"v":10583800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":22.1,"h":22.56,"l":21.96,"c":22.1,"v":11270300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":22.08,"h":22.15,"l":21.47,"c":21.77,"v":13427900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":21.93,"h":22.23,"l":21.73,"c":21.75,"v":10324500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":21.75,"h":22.61,"l":21.61,"c":22.6,"v":13918000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":22.45,"h":22.71,"l":22.29,"c":22.31,"v":9071600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":22.5,"h":22.7,"l":22.2,"c":22.23,"v":6732300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":22.44,"h":22.48,"l":21.73,"c":21.79,"v":8711400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":22.0,"h":22.54,"l":21.61,"c":22.42,"v":12890400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":22.25,"h":22.85,"l":21.97,"c":22.25,"v":8858000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":22.54,"h":22.69,"l":22.04,"c":22.36,"v":10035100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":22.44,"h":22.6,"l":22.06,"c":22.51,"v":24469800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o